{
  "header": {
    "corpus": "regressions/theme-file-extension",
    "description": "unstable_moduleResolution.themeFileExtension, mined from @stylexjs/babel-plugin 0.19.0 run live: suffix matching (bare + the six code extensions, case-sensitive, no boundary, no leading dot required), the derived `${ext}.const` suffix, hash independence from the option value, import-specifier gating, and the createTheme/create/defineMarker split. Twelve of the 66 mined probes are excluded because they diverge on other option gaps, not on this one: haste (E3), aliases/rewriteAliases (E6, E7, F1-F3), experimental_crossFileParsing (I1, I2), unknown keys inside unstable_moduleResolution (M2) and at the top level (E2), and the logAndDefault degradation of a non-string extension (E4, P1).",
    "oracle": "@stylexjs/babel-plugin@0.19.0",
    "written": "2026-08-29"
  },
